    "text": "The probability distribution of a random variable&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>X</mi></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>X</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>X</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3,4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5,6</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>otherwise</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mn>.</mn></math> Then, the conditional probability&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math> is"
  },
